8:["$","p","18",{"children":["You can configure this under ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["Settings → Policies"]}]," in your organization dashboard. Regardless of setting, request content is transmitted to the AI provider you select in order to fulfill the request (see ",["$","a","3",{"href":"#5-data-sharing","children":["Data Sharing"]}],")."]}]
