19:["$","ul","35",{"children":[["$","li","0",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["Service Providers / Sub-processors:"]}]," for hosting, analytics, payments, and email (see below)."]}],["$","li","1",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["AI Providers:"]}]," when routing your API requests to the model you select (e.g., OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Mistral, and others). Once your request reaches a provider, that provider processes it under ",["$","strong","2",{"children":["its own terms, privacy policy, and data-training practices"]}],", which vary by provider and which we do not control. You can review each provider's terms, privacy policy, headquarters, certifications, and AI-training and data-retention practices on our ",["$","a","6",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io/legal/providers","children":["Provider Information page"]}]," before selecting a model."]}],["$","li","2",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["Legal Authorities:"]}]," only where required by law or to protect our rights, users, or the public."]}],["$","li","3",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["Business transfers:"]}]," in connection with a merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets, subject to this Policy."]}]]}]
1a:["$","h3","36",{"id":"sub-processors","children":["Sub-processors"]}]
1b:["$","p","37",{"children":["We rely on a small set of vetted sub-processors for hosting, payments, email, analytics, and AI request processing. The complete, versioned list, including each sub-processor's purpose, the data it processes, its primary processing locations, and how we notify you before the list changes, is maintained on our ",["$","a","3",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io/legal/sub-processors","children":["Sub-processor page"]}],". That page is the authoritative disclosure; we do not duplicate the list here because it is updated independently of this Policy."]}]
1c:["$","hr","38",{}]
1d:["$","h2","39",{"id":"6-team-and-organization-management","children":["6. Team and Organization Management"]}]
1e:["$","p","40",{"children":["If you belong to an organization:"]}]
1f:["$","ul","41",{"children":[["$","li","0",{"children":["Owners and Admins can view and manage member data and roles."]}],["$","li","1",{"children":["Access is limited by assigned roles (Owner, Admin, Developer, Restricted Access)."]}]]}]
20:["$","p","42",{"children":["You can manage permissions from the ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["Team"]}]," page. Your organization is responsible for the personal data it processes through the Service and for the lawfulness of the Customer Data it submits."]}]
21:["$","hr","43",{}]
22:["$","h2","44",{"id":"7-data-retention","children":["7. Data Retention"]}]
23:["$","p","45",{"children":["We keep personal data only as long as necessary for the purposes it was collected, or as required by law:"]}]
24:["$","ul","46",{"children":[["$","li","0",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["Account and profile data"]}]," (name, email, login credentials, API keys): retained while your account is active; deleted promptly when you delete your account."]}],["$","li","1",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["AI request content and metadata:"]}]," request and response content is governed by your organization's retention setting (Retain All Data vs Metadata Only); aggregated usage and cost metadata is retained for analytics and billing accuracy."]}],["$","li","2",{"children":[["$","strong","0",{"children":["Billing and accounting records"]}]," (purchases of credits, payments, invoices, and the transaction history of credits bought and spent): retained for ",["$","strong","3",{"children":["10 years"]}]," to comply with applicable tax and accounting law, even after account deletion, after which they are deleted or anonymized."]}]]}]
25:["$","p","47",{"children":["Where we retain billing records after account deletion, we restrict processing of that data to what the law requires and anonymize personal identifiers not needed for the accounting record."]}]
26:["$","hr","48",{}]
27:["$","h2","49",{"id":"8-security","children":["8. Security"]}]
28:["$","p","50",{"children":["We implement industry-standard technical and organizational measures to protect personal data, including:"]}]
29:["$","ul","51",{"children":[["$","li","0",{"children":["HTTPS and encryption in transit"]}],["$","li","1",{"children":["Encryption at rest for stored provider credentials, and keyed one-way hashes\nfor new and rotated gateway API key secrets; authentication compares hashes\ninstead of recovering those secrets"]}],["$","li","2",{"children":["Access controls and authentication for sensitive data"]}],["$","li","3",{"children":["Regular security reviews and monitoring"]}]]}]
2a:["$","p","52",{"children":["No system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security. You are responsible for safeguarding your account credentials and API keys. If we become aware of a personal-data breach affecting you, we will notify you and any relevant authorities as required by applicable law."]}]
2b:["$","hr","53",{}]
2c:["$","h2","54",{"id":"9-your-privacy-rights","children":["9. Your Privacy Rights"]}]
2d:["$","p","55",{"children":["Depending on your location, you may have the right to:"]}]
2e:["$","ul","56",{"children":[["$","li","0",{"children":["Access, correct, or delete your personal data"]}],["$","li","1",{"children":["Export your data in a machine-readable format (portability)"]}],["$","li","2",{"children":["Withdraw consent for specific processing activities"]}],["$","li","3",{"children":["Object to or restrict certain processing activities"]}]]}]
2f:["$","p","57",{"children":["You can exercise these rights by emailing ",["$","strong","1",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"mailto:contact@vichar.io","children":["contact@vichar.io"]}]]}],". We will respond within the timeframe required by applicable law and may need to verify your identity first. You will not be discriminated against for exercising your rights."]}]
30:["$","h3","58",{"id":"euuk-gdpr","children":["EU/UK (GDPR)"]}]
31:["$","p","59",{"children":["If you are in the EU/EEA or UK, you may exercise the rights above and ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["lodge a complaint with your local data protection supervisory authority"]}],". International transfers of your data are safeguarded as described in ",["$","a","3",{"href":"#11-international-transfers","children":["Section 11"]}],"."]}]
32:["$","h3","60",{"id":"california-ccpacpra","children":["California (CCPA/CPRA)"]}]
33:["$","p","61",{"children":["If you are a California resident, you have the right to know, access, delete, and correct your personal information, and to opt out of its sale or sharing. ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["We do not sell or share personal information"]}]," as those terms are defined under the CCPA/CPRA, and we do not use it for cross-context behavioral advertising. We act as a ",["$","strong","4",{"children":["service provider"]}]," with respect to Customer Data processed on our customers' behalf. To exercise your rights, contact us at the email above; you may use an authorized agent."]}]
34:["$","h3","62",{"id":"limits-on-the-right-to-erasure","children":["Limits on the right to erasure"]}]
35:["$","p","63",{"children":["We will honor erasure requests except where we are legally obliged to retain data. In particular, ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["records of credits you purchased and spent"]}]," are kept to comply with tax and accounting law (see ",["$","a","3",{"href":"#7-data-retention","children":["Data Retention"]}],") and cannot be deleted on request during the statutory retention period. During that period we limit our processing of those records to what the law requires. Once the period ends, the data is deleted or anonymized."]}]
36:["$","hr","64",{}]
37:["$","h2","65",{"id":"10-ai-providers-and-your-data","children":["10. AI Providers and Your Data"]}]
38:["$","p","66",{"children":["When you route a request, the ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["content of that request is sent to the AI provider you select"]}]," so it can generate a response. Each provider handles data under its own policies, which differ in retention, sub-processing, geographic location, certifications (e.g., SOC 2, ISO 27001), and whether they use inputs for model training. We do not control those practices."]}]
39:["$","p","67",{"children":["Before selecting a model, we encourage you to review the provider's policies on our ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io/legal/providers","children":["Provider Information page"]}],", which links to each provider's terms, privacy policy, and data-training and compliance information. You are responsible for ensuring your selected provider is appropriate for the sensitivity of the data you submit."]}]
3a:["$","p","68",{"children":["Enterprise organizations can restrict routing using the complete provider compliance policy. Requests are rejected when no eligible provider remains."]}]
3b:["$","h3","69",{"id":"stealth-and-undisclosed-providers","children":["Stealth and Undisclosed Providers"]}]
3c:["$","p","70",{"children":["To improve availability, performance, and pricing, we may route some requests through ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["stealth providers"]}]," whose identity is not publicly disclosed (for example, providers offering preview or unreleased models under confidentiality). For these providers we ",["$","strong","3",{"children":["endeavor to obtain the same terms, privacy, and data-handling guarantees"]}]," described in this Policy, but because their identity and underlying practices are not disclosed to us or to you, ",["$","strong","5",{"children":["we cannot guarantee that they meet those standards"]}],"."]}]
3d:["$","p","71",{"children":["If you do not want your requests routed through stealth or undisclosed providers, you can ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["pin your requests to specific providers"]}]," that publicly declare their terms, privacy policy, and compliance posture on our ",["$","a","3",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io/legal/providers","children":["Provider Information page"]}],". You are responsible for selecting providers appropriate for the sensitivity of the data you submit."]}]
3e:["$","hr","72",{}]
3f:["$","h2","73",{"id":"11-international-transfers","children":["11. International Transfers"]}]
40:["$","p","74",{"children":["Data may be processed and stored on servers located in the ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["European Union or the United States"]}],", and may be transferred to AI providers and sub-processors in other countries. Where we transfer personal data internationally, we use appropriate safeguards required by applicable law, such as the ",["$","strong","4",{"children":["Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs)"]}]," or equivalent mechanisms, to protect your data."]}]
41:["$","hr","75",{}]
42:["$","h2","76",{"id":"12-childrens-privacy","children":["12. Children’s Privacy"]}]
43:["$","p","77",{"children":["The Service is ",["$","strong","1",{"children":["not intended for or directed to individuals under 18 years of age"]}],", consistent with our ",["$","a","3",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io/terms","children":["Terms of Use"]}],". We do not knowingly collect personal information from anyone under 18. If you believe a minor has provided us personal information, contact us and we will delete it."]}]
44:["$","hr","78",{}]
45:["$","h2","79",{"id":"13-changes-to-this-policy","children":["13. Changes to This Policy"]}]
46:["$","p","80",{"children":["We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. The latest version will always be available on our ",["$","a","1",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io/privacy","children":["Privacy Policy page"]}],", with an updated “Last Updated” date. For ",["$","strong","3",{"children":["material changes"]}],", we will provide reasonable notice (for example, by email or in-product notice). Your continued use of the Service after the changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the updated Policy."]}]
47:["$","hr","81",{}]
48:["$","h2","82",{"id":"14-contact-us","children":["14. Contact Us"]}]
49:["$","p","83",{"children":["If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or your data, or wish to exercise your rights, contact us at:",["$","br","2",{}],"📧 ",["$","strong","4",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"mailto:contact@vichar.io","children":["contact@vichar.io"]}]]}],["$","br","5",{}],"🌐 ",["$","strong","7",{"children":[["$","a","0",{"href":"https://app.vichar.io","children":["app.vichar.io"]}]]}]]}]
